      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "- Guinea & Senegambia is a living tradition with regional accent.\n- Focus: festivals.\n- Compared with Mali: shared heritage, distinct emphasis.\n- Forms: Mande forms.\n- Dance: dance.\n- Transmission: djembe tradition."
        }
      ]
    },
